# Build byproducts produced by build-espeak-ng.sh. The channel/compiler-rt
# glue objects are compiled fresh on each build (see GLUE_OBJ_DIR). The
# sibling *-cross-build/ and *-build/ trees are already covered by the root
# .gitignore; glue-objs/ does not match its *-glue-objs*/ pattern, so ignore
# it here instead of renaming the directory.
/glue-objs/
